		<RichText x="66" y="1164" width="443" height="97" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">灾生护罩：<span color="#ffe599">12岩</span><span>盾或</span><span color="#ffe599">48岩</span><span>盾(深渊)。受</span><span color="#bfceff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响，受到有附着的</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fffd7">风</span><span>/</span><span color="#99ffff">冰</span><span>元素的伤害时，</span><span color="#ffe599">-4</span><span>岩。<br/>「扎根」持续</span><span color="#ffdfbf">14s</span><span>，期间将缓慢恢复灾生护罩，进入「扎根」范围内将不会继续恢复，并在结束后恢复护罩</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50%</span><span>的厚度，若此时击破了护罩，则瘫痪</span><span color="#ffdfbf">12s</span><span>，恢复后</span><span color="#ffdfbf">恢复全部灾生护罩</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="9" y="1052" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">正常</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="9" y="1112" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#ffffff">瘫痪</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/厄生古树种.assets/Image_15.png')" x="64" y="64" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/厄生古树种.assets/Image_16.png')" x="596" y="1099" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/厄生古树种.assets/Image_17.png')" x="596" y="1323" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/厄生古树种.assets/Image_18.png')" x="596" y="875" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="399" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">古树从地里面扣出一块晶髓，扔向玩家，造成<span color="#ffe599">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="927" width="424" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">击破护罩后，树妖蹲伏地面，在玩家处唤出厄生刺丛，造成<span color="#ffe599">50%</span><span>伤害，该刺随后向外扩张，造成</span><span color="#ffe599">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1151" width="424" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">树妖初始附属<span textDecoration="underline">灾生护罩</span><span>，在护罩击破后树妖将汲取灾厄之力，使其能够释放灾厄晶体的相关技能，并能在一段时间后进行「扎根」恢复护罩。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="1375" width="442" height="200" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">护罩破除后，若生命值低于<span color="#ffdfbf">40%</span><span>或经过</span><span color="#ffdfbf">50s</span><span>，树妖将大跳到场地边缘进行「扎根」，持续恢复护罩厚度。期间持续生成厄生刺丛，并额外生成追踪性赤髓，造成</span><span color="#ffe599">80%</span><span>伤害。在蓄力完成时将发射大量不稳定赤髓，造成</span><span color="#ffe599">100%</span><span>伤害。进入「扎根」范围内后树妖不再进行攻击。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="438" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">古树突然跃起，并重重击地，造成<span color="#ffe599">125%</span><span>伤害。开局使用时，造成</span><span color="#b8b8b8">100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="364" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">树妖进行3段普通攻击，依次造成<span color="#ffe599">75%,75%,100%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
